# Zoom profile driven by the Logi ZoomMeeting plugin, which talks to Zoom
# directly rather than firing keystrokes.  Command list extracted from
# Plugins/ZoomMeeting/mac/ZoomPlugin.dll.
#   logikit build "Zoom (logikit)" --file zoom.keys --replace

# ---------- Page 1: running the class ----------
Share Screen | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.ToggleShareScreenCommand        | #12233F | #7FB4FF | play
Mute         | $ZoomMeeting___ZoomMuteToggleCommand | #3A2E10 | #FFD980 | chat
Video        | $ZoomMeeting___ZoomVideoToggleCommand| #3A2E10 | #FFD980 | play
Mute All     | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.MuteAllParticipantsCommand      | #2E1B4D | #C79BFF | chat
Unmute All   | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.UnmuteAllParticipantsCommand    | #2E1B4D | #C79BFF | chat
Chat         | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.ToggleChatCommand               | #10301F | #6FE3A6 | chat
Gallery/Spkr | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.ToggleGallerySpeakerViewCommand | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF | home
Raise Hand   | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.RaiseLowerHandCommand           | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF | star
Leave        | $ZoomMeeting___ZoomLeaveMeetingCommand | #2A1416 | #FF8A8A | close

---

# ---------- Page 2: recording, annotation, extras ----------
Record       | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.StartStopLocalRecordingCommand  | #3A1212 | #FF9B9B | play
Pause Rec    | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.PauseResumeRecordingCommand     | #3A2E10 | #FFD980 | clock
Cloud Rec    | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.StartStopCloudRecordingCommand  | #3A1212 | #FF9B9B | globe
Annotate     | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.AnnotateCommand                 | #2E1B4D | #C79BFF | code
Clear Draw   | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.ClearAllDrawingsCommand         | #2E1B4D | #C79BFF | close
Full Screen  | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.ToggleFullScreenCommand         | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF | home
Blur BG      | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.ToggleBlurBackgroundCommand     | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF | star
Switch Cam   | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.SwitchCameraCommand             | #1A1A1A | #FFFFFF | search
Copy Invite  | plugin:ZoomMeeting:Loupedeck.ZoomPlugin.CopyInviteLinkCommand           | #1E3A5F | #8FC7FF | doc
